Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.86,1:23:38.13,theme_rom,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,200)}{\be1}Ashita mata shiawase de aru youni...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.72,1:23:59.00,theme_rom,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,200)}{\be1}Ashita mata shiawase de aru youni...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.44,0:02:04.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就能见到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.31,0:02:37.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.72,0:03:56.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接好了 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.13,0:04:04.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.62,0:04:08.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 这不是叫你练习不接住球啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.15,0:04:12.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要好好找回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.22,0:04:15.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了啦 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.51,0:04:20.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们先回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.37,0:04:22.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么这样...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.88,0:04:25.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是因为你没接到球呀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.39,0:04:28.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是 再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.25,0:04:31.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回家啦 回家啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.73,0:04:35.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 对了 你要小心蛇喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.00,0:04:38.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.41,0:04:47.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 蛇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.57,0:04:58.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好深
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.45,0:05:00.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会游泳吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.54,0:05:02.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会游泳的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.78,0:05:11.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪 哪儿 哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.62,0:05:12.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.13,0:05:15.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.63,0:05:22.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快停下 好痒呀
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.85,0:05:29.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那 明天见喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.80,0:05:33.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法呀 小咪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.49,0:05:36.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看 是哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.29,0:05:38.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在约会吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.95,0:05:42.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧 发条老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.00,0:05:46.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有我在 大雄什么也做不好的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.99,0:05:49.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.47,0:05:53.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.59,0:06:00.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀 老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.34,0:06:07.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 不要跟着我 不行的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.33,0:06:10.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈绝对不会同意的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.79,0:06:15.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.33,0:06:25.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.32,0:06:30.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.43,0:07:49.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 小狗啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.14,0:07:53.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 老鼠啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.02,0:07:53.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.94,0:07:55.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.13,0:08:00.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这小狗是怎么回事 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.86,0:08:05.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.26,0:08:08.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁妈妈还没发觉的时候 放到房间去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.09,0:08:09.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.48,0:08:11.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.87,0:08:13.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄也在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.27,0:08:14.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.68,0:08:18.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乖一点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.43,0:08:24.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次被发现的是距今3亿年前的遗址
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.14,0:08:26.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怀疑是在人类甚至在恐龙诞生以前
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.95,0:08:29.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被判断为具有很高的文明
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.26,0:08:34.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在经过许多考古学家和文人的研究后
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.31,0:08:36.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在已经受到了世界各国的注视
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.31,0:08:38.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来的新闻...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.31,0:08:39.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.86,0:08:40.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.55,0:08:43.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们俩的点心在冰箱里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.51,0:08:45.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 多谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.79,0:08:51.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫什么名字好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.85,0:08:54.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呀
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.14,0:08:55.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.35,0:09:02.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了 「汪」在英语是[一]的意思\N{\fs22}（注：「汪」跟英语的「ONE」发音相近）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.35,0:09:02.98,Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.98,0:09:04.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就叫小一怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.87,0:09:07.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 嗯 不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.56,0:09:08.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.55,0:09:10.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜欢吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.35,0:09:16.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问题是能瞒着妈妈多久
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.96,0:09:19.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『挂壁式狗窝』
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.63,0:09:21.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之 只好先把他养在这
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.41,0:09:24.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就放在这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.34,0:09:26.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.80,0:09:27.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.89,0:09:28.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不错呀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.53,0:09:32.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 这是你的家哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.19,0:09:36.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要乖啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.84,0:09:42.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么可爱 怎么会被丢弃的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.78,0:09:57.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.68,0:09:59.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,买什么好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.70,0:10:01.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竹荚鱼怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.79,0:10:04.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竹荚鱼啊 那就要这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.67,0:10:06.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢惠顾
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.68,0:10:09.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多给点嘛 大伯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.15,0:10:13.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我家有个人要吃两人份的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.35,0:10:14.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多给点啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.73,0:10:17.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法 就送你一条吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.72,0:10:24.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什么 这些混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.12,0:10:32.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋 真是群无法无天的猫
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.57,0:10:53.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 是小一啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.05,0:10:59.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安 小一
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.38,0:11:04.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.34,0:11:06.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.73,0:11:09.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.74,0:11:12.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫小一啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.91,0:11:15.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 过来打个招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.72,0:11:18.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.54,0:11:23.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香将来要当我新娘的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.28,0:11:24.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.20,0:11:25.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.21,0:11:28.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 她是静香
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.03,0:11:29.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请多多关照
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.92,0:11:32.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 好聪明呀
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.26,0:11:36.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是所谓「物似主人形」
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.13,0:11:43.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讨厌啦 也不用这么大反应吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.81,0:11:53.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你居然会主动做功课啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.17,0:11:58.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们真好 不用做功课
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.03,0:12:04.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 那是...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.12,0:12:07.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个剑玉果然是...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.71,0:12:08.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.62,0:12:12.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是大雄 写成大狗了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.95,0:12:17.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 这是我小时候 奶奶买给我的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.00,0:12:26.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.03,0:12:26.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.01,0:12:41.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-喂 喂 乌龟先生 乌龟先生哟-♪-
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.90,0:12:47.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-全世界没有比你更慢的了-♪-
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.90,0:12:53.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-没有可以束缚你的东西-♪-
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.80,0:12:59.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-然而你为何如此缓慢-♪-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.78,0:13:02.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绳子断了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.54,0:13:12.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢小一 谢谢 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.56,0:13:26.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.19,0:13:27.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.55,0:13:30.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 会被妈妈发现的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.05,0:13:33.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁在外面吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.05,0:13:41.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没见过的猫呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.38,0:13:44.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是觉得那只小猫好可怜是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.77,0:13:46.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了 知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.05,0:13:52.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 已经没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.94,0:13:54.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被谁丢了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.96,0:14:06.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来一直过得很辛苦的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.89,0:14:11.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给 你也饿了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.16,0:14:14.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从今天起它就是你的朋友了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.66,0:14:17.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你被淋得湿答答的 就叫阿答吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.50,0:14:22.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样一来 它们的食物成了问题
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.91,0:14:24.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要好好想办法才行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.79,0:14:30.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.08,0:14:34.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我偶尔经过 发现它们被丢在管子里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.36,0:14:38.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样下去太可怜了 你帮我想想办法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.19,0:14:45.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 妈妈还在睡午觉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.21,0:14:49.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么为难的时候 哆啦A梦跑到哪里去了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.63,0:14:51.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.33,0:14:53.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听了你们一定吓一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.29,0:14:56.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『免费食物制造机』
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.62,0:15:01.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由水和空气为原材料培养出小球藻
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.01,0:15:05.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以根据猫和狗的喜好 制造出他们喜欢的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.43,0:15:09.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样食物的问题就解决了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.70,0:15:12.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个东西很贵的 可要小心使用哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.87,0:15:15.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 小一
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.27,0:15:21.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就觉得有古怪嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.12,0:15:24.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近冰箱里的食物经常少了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.14,0:15:25.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.14,0:15:27.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.06,0:15:28.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被发现就不得了了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.87,0:15:31.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『随意门』
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.01,0:15:33.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去远处的深山里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.51,0:15:36.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 快
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.19,0:15:40.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.39,0:15:41.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,究竟是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.51,0:15:47.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然有狗的叫声 之前就很可疑了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.08,0:15:49.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.48,0:15:51.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.89,0:15:56.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 新闻有报道过
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.62,0:15:59.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人把不要的猫狗丢在了山里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.35,0:16:03.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太过分了 但是怎么都跑到这里来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.93,0:16:16.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,土地被开发 改造成别墅
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.33,0:16:18.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那这些小狗们怎么办才好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.61,0:16:22.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『缩微灯』
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.53,0:16:36.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个地方怎么行的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.54,0:16:41.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之在找到好的地方之前先忍耐着
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.00,0:16:43.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家要乖乖的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.48,0:16:54.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 老鼠 讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.13,0:16:57.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.92,0:16:59.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.15,0:17:01.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们在这里做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.33,0:17:05.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.71,0:17:08.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事呀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.64,0:17:16.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是这么一回事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.98,0:17:21.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不容易来到世上却没地方住 太可怜了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.00,0:17:23.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可以随便丢弃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.92,0:17:26.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呀 是人不好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.18,0:17:29.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.06,0:17:38.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在还没有人类出现的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.79,0:17:44.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把它们带到那遥远的过去就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.72,0:17:52.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有恐龙 没有欺负猫跟狗的动物
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.35,0:17:54.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很遥远的过去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.39,0:18:04.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 就是3亿年前
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.81,0:18:26.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧 小一 这里的全部都是你们的世界哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.81,0:18:30.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 这里有食物吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.68,0:18:31.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.26,0:18:33.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 过来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.44,0:18:40.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有这个的话就不用担心了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.27,0:18:44.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好了 小一 使用方法是...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.66,0:18:46.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它又听不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.52,0:18:48.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.14,0:18:50.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.45,0:18:53.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『进化退化光线枪』
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.82,0:18:56.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,调到进化的方向
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.54,0:19:06.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厉害\N站起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.37,0:19:09.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来比大雄还聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.54,0:19:12.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 听得懂我的话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.03,0:19:15.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那听好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.21,0:19:19.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 我们到那边去练习棒球吧\N首先 按这个键
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.46,0:19:20.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK\N然后...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.87,0:19:25.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后按这个红色按纽 明白吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.40,0:19:27.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 你试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.69,0:19:32.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厉害 不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.27,0:19:38.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.14,0:19:39.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.16,0:19:42.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是小一
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.10,0:19:43.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.45,0:19:45.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来来来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.07,0:19:48.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真顽皮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.32,0:19:54.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-喂 喂 乌龟先生 乌龟先生哟-♪-
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.01,0:19:58.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-全世界没有比你更慢的了-♪-
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.48,0:20:02.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玩得真棒 学得好快呀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.94,0:20:06.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好 小一 你可是大家的领袖哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.33,0:20:25.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做好了 这就是你们的旗帜
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.65,0:20:26.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国旗哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.36,0:20:29.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么是漩涡呀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.55,0:20:31.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是大雄的名字吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.50,0:20:35.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 是野猫野狗的野
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.47,0:20:37.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不都一样嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.61,0:20:39.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是单纯的思维啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.42,0:20:49.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.66,0:20:50.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.27,0:20:53.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 明天会再来的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.72,0:20:55.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家保重
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.99,0:21:01.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们约定好 明天一定会来的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.68,0:21:04.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 快点呀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.56,0:21:05.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.18,0:21:27.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大... 雄...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.49,0:21:32.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天一定会来的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.16,0:21:41.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是的 不要随便用我的『后备百宝袋』啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.44,0:21:43.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是道歉了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.96,0:21:45.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.79,0:21:46.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.80,0:21:49.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没听到我说吗 你们真是...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.00,0:21:53.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思 你要说教的话到了那再说不迟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.98,0:21:55.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只好这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.58,0:21:56.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.20,0:22:00.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么我就这么宠他呀
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.47,0:22:07.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.88,0:22:11.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时光错转 时光错转
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.11,0:22:17.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 快想想办法呀
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.74,0:22:20.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事呀
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.39,0:22:28.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.59,0:22:32.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了 忘了按调节键
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.60,0:22:49.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.67,0:22:51.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和昨天不一样的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.86,0:22:53.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.90,0:22:59.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本来设定是3亿年前
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.51,0:23:01.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在却晚了一千年
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.07,0:23:05.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是昨天的千年后的世界啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.35,0:23:06.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是那样
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.11,0:23:10.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 看呀
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.37,0:23:14.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是城市 已经有城市了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.98,0:23:18.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只过了千年就已经...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.87,0:23:22.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和我们住的城市一样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.55,0:23:24.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有谁过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.32,0:23:26.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.09,0:23:28.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个无聊死了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.00,0:23:30.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,娜古对电影太过于讲究了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.07,0:23:32.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧见了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.56,0:23:35.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫狗穿着人的衣服像人一样在行走
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.37,0:23:37.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且说的是日语
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.69,0:23:38.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.95,0:23:42.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只过了一千年而已 就进化到了这个程度
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.39,0:23:43.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 难道是因为...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.88,0:23:47.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把『进化退化光线枪』忘在那儿的关系吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.19,0:23:50.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么 那么小一他们...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.12,0:23:54.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使用了那个 进化成这个样子了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.37,0:23:56.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那小一怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.01,0:23:59.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然已经不在这了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.36,0:24:00.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.99,0:24:04.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天 和他约好一定会来的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.65,0:24:08.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点修好『时光机』 回到千年前吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.80,0:24:13.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有部分零件被卷走了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.31,0:24:15.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们该怎么办呀
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.67,0:24:18.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系 以这个国家的文明程度
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.98,0:24:20.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该可以找到零件的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.96,0:24:22.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.04,0:24:24.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那只要修好了 我们就可以回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.50,0:24:26.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 所以
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.38,0:24:30.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『猫狗耳饰』
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.58,0:24:33.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用这个就可以变成这个世界的人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.56,0:24:35.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.59,0:24:37.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 尾巴
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.41,0:24:38.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.32,0:24:42.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看 我变成小猫了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.69,0:24:45.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当然是用猫耳饰了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.98,0:24:47.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是狸猫吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.51,0:24:49.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太失礼了 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.35,0:24:53.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 大雄你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.14,0:24:55.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,觉得怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.72,0:24:57.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像小一
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.47,0:25:01.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们就去这个世界探险吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.24,0:25:02.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.93,0:25:04.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 快点呀
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.77,0:25:28.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搽了就能快速长毛
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.73,0:25:30.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有生毛水呢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.49,0:25:32.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长成狮子了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.53,0:25:44.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫杰啦乐园25周年
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.38,0:25:46.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时速300公里游乐车
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.68,0:25:49.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有很多梦般的冒险
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.41,0:25:51.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等着大家哟
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.56,0:25:54.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害呀 真是个大都市
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.91,0:25:56.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.65,0:25:58.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.43,0:26:00.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狗是警察啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.71,0:26:02.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迷路的是小猫啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.67,0:26:06.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说 从刚才开始 我们就好像被当笑话在看
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.26,0:26:08.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起这个 我肚子可饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.67,0:26:10.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.01,0:26:21.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由水和空气生成的小球藻制造的免费食物
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.19,0:26:23.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.42,0:26:26.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用『免费食物制造机 』作成的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.47,0:26:30.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.05,0:26:31.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,调味不错
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.78,0:26:33.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃呀
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.21,0:26:35.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是被改造过的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.05,0:26:37.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时光错乱是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.46,0:26:42.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是说 在一个时光隧道和另一个缠绕住了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.72,0:26:46.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们才被卷到了千年后啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.02,0:26:47.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.00,0:27:19.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心...跳...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.54,0:27:27.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真悦耳的歌声
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.61,0:27:31.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小意思 比起我的还差远了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.94,0:27:34.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 你先坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.05,0:27:51.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.52,0:27:55.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 你真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.28,0:28:07.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山猫轩的歌姬 夏咪
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.95,0:28:13.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪小姐 我叫哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.43,0:28:16.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请叫我哆啦A梦 请收下这个
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.94,0:28:18.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.87,0:28:21.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还是初次见到你这样的猫族
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.03,0:28:25.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫 你是说我是猫吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.36,0:28:27.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是『七色铃』
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.88,0:28:29.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.16,0:28:31.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有铜锣烧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.56,0:28:33.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦的魔术很有趣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.86,0:28:38.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么说我都是22世纪的猫型机器人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.60,0:28:40.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.29,0:28:44.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪小姐 等等我 我马上就来
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.85,0:28:48.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我呀 夏咪
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.85,0:28:50.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来中毒颇深呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.18,0:28:57.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪小姐 这个 那个 我...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.29,0:29:00.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我拿走啦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.81,0:29:01.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.74,0:29:05.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抢别人的东西可是不好的呀
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.52,0:29:07.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快还回来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.22,0:29:08.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.87,0:29:10.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达古
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.11,0:29:13.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才是你们的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.12,0:29:14.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太郎 那就拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.68,0:29:15.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 快追
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.77,0:29:17.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.40,0:29:18.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.65,0:29:20.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那边 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.40,0:29:25.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.64,0:29:27.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,往那边逃了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.12,0:29:27.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.76,0:29:35.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快还回来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.99,0:29:37.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达古
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.78,0:29:39.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知子
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.11,0:29:40.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我拿走了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.76,0:29:42.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 我生气了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.42,0:29:46.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『念力眼药水』
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.78,0:29:50.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痲
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.34,0:29:54.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,集中念力
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.37,0:30:01.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.85,0:30:05.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.11,0:30:08.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.16,0:30:09.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 振作点
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.01,0:30:13.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个我拿走啦
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.00,0:30:13.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.93,0:30:15.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.87,0:30:20.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.82,0:30:26.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.01,0:30:33.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可真行呀
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.70,0:30:35.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也是呀
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.24,0:30:52.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然跑的这么快
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.79,0:31:02.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个不是诺雷珠 还给你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.20,0:31:04.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 你是小一吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.98,0:31:06.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.31,0:31:09.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道你是从哪个地区来的 但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.79,0:31:14.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从生下来就一直叫小八
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.37,0:31:15.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.83,0:31:19.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呀 大雄 都过了千年了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.39,0:31:21.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一不可能在的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.91,0:31:25.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 夏咪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.91,0:31:30.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 别管那个啦 我听他们说了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.28,0:31:33.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是个铃铛而已\N说了什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.70,0:31:32.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.33,0:31:41.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说大家都是孤儿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.52,0:31:47.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知子和父母一起去了猫杰啦游乐园玩
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.46,0:31:52.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是只有我们回来了 他们都失踪了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.21,0:31:54.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的爸爸也是
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.07,0:31:57.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太郎的爸爸也是那样
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.16,0:32:00.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知子的父母是数学家
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.74,0:32:03.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达古的爸爸是电脑技术专家
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.07,0:32:07.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有太郎的爸爸 在这里的修理工厂工作的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.08,0:32:11.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这当中一定有什么联系
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.34,0:32:12.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警察说什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.93,0:32:15.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去过了 但他们都偏袒猫杰啦游乐园
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.06,0:32:17.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本不相信我们
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.72,0:32:18.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.26,0:32:23.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么说 猫杰啦游乐园的社长猫杰啦是有钱人
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.71,0:32:27.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一任的总统候选人 很有势力的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.13,0:32:31.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以大家就聚在了一起
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.10,0:32:32.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起一个人要好
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.89,0:32:36.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家合力一起去查要好得多
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.39,0:32:40.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且我感觉猫杰啦游乐园里隐藏了天大的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.92,0:32:43.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定要把他找出来
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.71,0:32:44.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有个好东西要给大家看
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.90,0:32:45.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达古
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.66,0:32:49.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要多事
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.95,0:32:52.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.58,0:32:56.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 我们也来帮忙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.45,0:32:59.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对呀 我也正这么想呢
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.58,0:33:01.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 但是
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.58,0:33:05.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 我们是正义的伙伴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.93,0:33:10.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 大家一起携手干吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.19,0:33:14.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连衣服都买不起…还真是让人感动呀
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.86,0:33:17.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连衣服都买不起是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.73,0:33:20.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为 这不是内衣吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.19,0:33:26.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个还是赤裸裸的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.52,0:33:29.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『换衣服照相机』
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.67,0:33:41.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一想到原来在夏咪面前没穿衣服就...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.71,0:33:46.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 真是失礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.96,0:34:00.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 这是真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.97,0:34:05.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 那一定要好好注意这只猫
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.97,0:34:07.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.96,0:34:10.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的事在这本黑暗默示录中有记载
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.94,0:34:13.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得到机械构造的猫的话
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.59,0:34:18.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要占领人类世界简直是易如反掌
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.41,0:34:32.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.55,0:34:38.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是小八啊 晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.02,0:34:48.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.57,0:34:58.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.23,0:35:00.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.86,0:35:02.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.50,0:35:05.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要推了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.07,0:35:10.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了这个就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.13,0:35:15.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 不可以偷东西
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.82,0:35:17.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是小八
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.26,0:35:19.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八 快还回去
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.04,0:35:22.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要啰哩啰嗦的说教
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.57,0:35:24.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.28,0:35:27.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.25,0:35:43.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 大家都到哪去了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.35,0:35:45.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是去了猫杰啦游乐园
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.86,0:35:47.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.18,0:36:07.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜 25周年
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.05,0:36:09.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝各位有愉快的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.23,0:36:10.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎来到猫杰啦游乐园
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.62,0:36:12.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.01,0:36:29.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家不是来玩的 不要擅自行动
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.44,0:36:30.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.77,0:36:32.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是猫爪机
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.17,0:36:34.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要玩那个
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.94,0:36:36.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.36,0:36:38.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香 那个怎么样呀
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.82,0:36:40.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.12,0:36:41.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.93,0:36:41.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我刚说就...\N- 不错似的　- 去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.58,0:36:44.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是看起来很好玩的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.34,0:36:45.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.24,0:36:47.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.59,0:36:59.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓到了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.04,0:37:01.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.14,0:37:31.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.06,0:37:32.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家请慢慢下车
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.38,0:37:35.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 你也乐在其中了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.74,0:37:37.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.88,0:37:38.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是小八
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.43,0:37:41.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.28,0:37:42.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诺雷珠呢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.65,0:37:45.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿到了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.72,0:37:50.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了这个就没问题了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.18,0:37:54.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开动了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.62,0:37:59.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边没错吧 别挖错到运河了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.32,0:38:03.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八 不要担心 我的计算不会错的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.62,0:38:06.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为小八不会游泳啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.97,0:38:10.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是这样的 太郎 拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.89,0:38:24.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫杰啦游乐园25周年特别节目 有请夏咪小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.15,0:38:33.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.96,0:38:54.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.98,0:38:58.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家往那边逃
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.62,0:39:06.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『发光粉』
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.89,0:39:08.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.82,0:39:10.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.20,0:39:11.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.75,0:39:13.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.01,0:39:17.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么你们会在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.42,0:39:18.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们才是
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.42,0:39:22.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是来找猫杰啦游乐园的秘密的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.64,0:39:25.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个地下很可疑
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.08,0:39:27.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了 已经不能用了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.60,0:39:32.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 我们快出去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.49,0:39:34.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.03,0:39:37.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样空手而回吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.23,0:39:38.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.45,0:39:40.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 危险
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.28,0:39:46.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 小八
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.21,0:39:53.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.77,0:39:56.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太郎 达古 知子
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.16,0:39:57.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被封住了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.59,0:40:00.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系的 有哆啦A梦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.68,0:40:06.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要这么关心我
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.76,0:40:08.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.19,0:40:14.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八 大雄\N我找我找我找我找
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.14,0:40:18.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你们是为了什么来的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.75,0:40:24.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了赴约
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.36,0:40:27.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赴约？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.35,0:40:30.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『地鼠手套』
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.87,0:40:37.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的小一和我很像吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.04,0:40:44.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们没受伤吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.72,0:40:49.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连诺雷珠都不用就...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.33,0:40:52.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诺雷珠是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.17,0:40:54.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们真是什么也不知道呀
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.23,0:40:57.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是让所有的机器启动的能源
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.22,0:40:57.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能源？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.95,0:41:00.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是能量源呀
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.73,0:41:05.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 看来我的能量也没多少了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.25,0:41:06.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎接力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.54,0:41:10.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 交给我吧 开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.44,0:41:13.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快住手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.62,0:41:15.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.91,0:41:25.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大总统 地震是由陨石落下引起的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.38,0:41:27.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去调查伤亡的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.32,0:41:31.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,具体情况还不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.28,0:41:34.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,推测陨石坠落地点是在东北山岳附近
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.90,0:41:39.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直径在20-30米左右
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.42,0:41:41.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 20-30米
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.74,0:41:44.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,区区20-30米左右就能造成那么大的震荡
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.08,0:41:49.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诸位 我们不能再这样继续欺骗民众了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.64,0:41:52.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该立即把计划发表出去
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.86,0:41:59.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大总统
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.54,0:42:01.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 猫杰啦先生
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.16,0:42:06.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在只有36个小时了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.18,0:42:10.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要我可以做的 请您尽管说
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.47,0:42:15.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对你平日的相助真是万分感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.67,0:42:22.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对于猫狗国这是我应该做的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.47,0:42:41.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫杰啦阁下 差不多是时候了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.52,0:43:13.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定这个是...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.86,0:43:18.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.54,0:43:19.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.29,0:43:24.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.75,0:43:25.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.67,0:43:32.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八的妈妈是猫？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.19,0:43:34.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八是小时候被捡来的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.50,0:43:41.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来大家是被迫在这里工作
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.37,0:43:44.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 快想想办法呀
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.36,0:43:45.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.73,0:43:46.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知子
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.65,0:43:52.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知子 不要擅自行动啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.20,0:43:52.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.70,0:43:54.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.09,0:43:56.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们从哪进来的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.84,0:43:59.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不是什么可疑份子
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.79,0:44:01.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.36,0:44:06.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我看见了 就得把你们抓起来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.16,0:44:10.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家快逃呀
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.58,0:44:14.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.56,0:44:18.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 快想办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.26,0:44:22.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是第6小队 发现入侵者 快来支援
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.19,0:44:27.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.75,0:44:28.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知子
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.38,0:44:28.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达古
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.78,0:44:31.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八也来了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.15,0:44:33.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.24,0:44:37.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 不是 不是
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.49,0:44:39.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了 在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.36,0:44:43.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『地洞圈』
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.37,0:44:53.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们做了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.12,0:44:56.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 有没有什么武器吗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.36,0:44:59.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么说我都是维护家庭和平
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.97,0:45:02.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以阳光未来为目标啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.73,0:45:03.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.40,0:45:07.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『消光暗灯』
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.41,0:45:09.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真是好帮忙的机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.47,0:45:12.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.59,0:45:17.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家跟在我后面
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.70,0:45:14.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.59,0:45:24.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 你在哪呀
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.49,0:45:20.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖 胖虎 你在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.98,0:45:22.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓到他们了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.55,0:45:26.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边 这边
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.30,0:45:27.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.95,0:45:29.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏 夏咪
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.82,0:45:31.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄拿着
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.24,0:45:33.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.16,0:45:40.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们给我老实点
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.52,0:45:43.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命呀
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.62,0:45:46.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.90,0:45:51.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.87,0:45:52.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危险
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.37,0:46:01.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.52,0:46:10.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你醒了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.63,0:46:16.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.15,0:46:20.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她要是有个三长两短 我不会原谅你的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.54,0:46:23.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个不用你担心
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.38,0:46:27.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要你听我的话就不会有事
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.50,0:46:30.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是猫杰啦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.34,0:46:34.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是猫杰啦游乐园的主人
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.32,0:46:38.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫杰啦左卫门之丞景虎
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.05,0:46:40.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好长的名字呀
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.02,0:46:43.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在地下制造的是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.71,0:46:46.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你是记载在...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.26,0:46:50.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑暗默示录里记载机器猫自然会明白的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.23,0:46:53.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然是『时光机』
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.51,0:46:59.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 可以自由穿梭在时间和空间里的方舟
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.63,0:47:01.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拥有不可思议的口袋
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.28,0:47:02.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以拿出不可思议的工具
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.77,0:47:05.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的事情都写在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.04,0:47:07.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是谁写的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.76,0:47:09.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我告诉你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.61,0:47:14.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一千年前 我们猫杰啦族伟大的先祖
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.93,0:47:16.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿答大人
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.30,0:47:17.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿答...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.71,0:47:25.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为被雨淋透 就叫阿答吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.98,0:47:31.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是这么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.93,0:47:35.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 造那么大的一个『时光机』要做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.34,0:47:40.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大总统的发表时间到了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.41,0:47:42.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听完了 我再告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.84,0:47:49.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敬爱的猫狗国的各位
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.68,0:47:53.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一个悲惨事实要告诉大家
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.72,0:47:58.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在36小时候后 我们美丽的地球
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.16,0:48:00.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将要面临的是陨石群的撞击
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.56,0:48:02.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.07,0:48:06.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最大的陨石直径有20千米
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.63,0:48:09.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的动植物将面临死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.61,0:48:12.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地表将会受到大冲击
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.48,0:48:14.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此 这个世界
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.58,0:48:19.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在21世纪消失的谜团终于解开了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.96,0:48:22.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 这并不代表绝望了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.18,0:48:27.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们很早就察觉到了这个事实
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.63,0:48:30.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因此早就准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.53,0:48:33.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是离开地球计划
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.00,0:48:36.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个计划是
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.32,0:48:39.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备可以容载全民众
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.83,0:48:43.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离开地球的宇宙船已经完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.28,0:48:48.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放进诺雷珠就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.73,0:48:53.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们移民到的星球是在大犬座的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.16,0:48:56.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,环境和地球很相近
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.61,0:49:02.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离开这个美丽的地球是很心痛
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.11,0:49:04.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望全民众一起同心协力
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.34,0:49:08.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿出勇气一起向新的世界出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.36,0:49:13.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听到了吗 再拖下去就很不妙
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.16,0:49:15.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦和小八到哪里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.25,0:49:20.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋 你要干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.89,0:49:24.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好听着 时间方舟已经造好了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.88,0:49:27.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们已经没有利用价值了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.75,0:49:31.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就乖乖地和地球一起灭亡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.79,0:49:34.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.96,0:49:41.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我们一族的目的地 不是宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.31,0:49:46.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是通过『时光机』去未来
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.08,0:49:47.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未 未来
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.72,0:49:51.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 就是去征服未来的人类世界
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.53,0:49:55.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让全人类成为我们的宠物
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.64,0:49:58.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宠物 为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.73,0:50:00.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在黑暗默示录里写着
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.28,0:50:02.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一族的先祖 狗和猫
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.95,0:50:07.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是经历了何等的残酷对待
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.86,0:50:13.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类对于宠物 任意的争夺
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.76,0:50:16.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厌烦的时候就作为礼物送走或随便丢弃
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.50,0:50:19.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类是恶魔的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.80,0:50:26.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能再让人类待在这个地球上
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.13,0:50:31.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是猫族的话 就应该帮助我
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.18,0:50:34.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样的事我怎么可能帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.95,0:50:39.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就没办法了 你看看这个吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.64,0:50:45.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏 夏咪
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.67,0:50:56.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不同意的话 夏咪会怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.06,0:51:01.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好过份
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.72,0:51:08.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.69,0:51:15.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发是今天下午 大家冷静跟着行动
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.28,0:51:18.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发时间是今天下午
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.57,0:51:22.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的计划就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.89,0:51:24.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你欺骗了我们
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.82,0:51:27.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是说只有你们离开吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.81,0:51:29.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且是去未来
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.76,0:51:32.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们要把人类怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.30,0:51:41.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样 机械的猫
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.48,0:51:46.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要我怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.80,0:51:49.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.10,0:51:56.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.59,0:52:01.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是 『进化退化光线枪』
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.59,0:52:05.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 我要你修好它
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.70,0:52:12.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用这个可以把凶暴的人类退化成原始人
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.64,0:52:15.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,征服起来就简单了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.58,0:52:18.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.66,0:52:23.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你修好这个 就可以救夏咪了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.57,0:52:26.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然这个时速300公里的轨车
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.84,0:52:30.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样从夏咪的身上开过
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.36,0:52:37.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么能这样
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.90,0:52:39.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.43,0:52:49.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.51,0:52:51.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快停下
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.92,0:52:55.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你修不修理『进化退化光线枪』
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.97,0:52:57.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.65,0:53:21.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个修好 那你也没用了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.36,0:53:22.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼悟
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.40,0:53:23.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.54,0:53:25.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他打成废铁吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.44,0:53:28.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.77,0:53:32.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪 太好了你没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.23,0:53:35.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪 辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.70,0:53:38.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个机器猫还有用
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.02,0:53:43.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他不听话的话到时再铲除也不迟
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.47,0:53:46.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难不成夏咪你
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.84,0:53:50.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这个难不成
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.35,0:53:53.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把这个机器猫关进『时光机』里去
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.97,0:53:55.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然这样...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.34,0:53:59.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪你竟然是他的同伙
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.60,0:54:01.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.96,0:54:03.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.13,0:54:11.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带下去
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.33,0:54:12.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.32,0:54:20.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样所有的准备都齐了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.41,0:54:22.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼悟 实行B计划
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.95,0:54:23.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.90,0:54:27.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,B计划是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.22,0:54:31.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将政府的诺雷珠搞到手
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.62,0:54:33.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 这么做的话
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.87,0:54:37.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家不就不能离开地球了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.00,0:54:39.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么关系
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.76,0:54:44.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要启动时间方舟是需要庞大的能源的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.30,0:54:46.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么这样
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.80,0:54:50.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪 你也是猫杰啦家族的一份子
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.00,0:54:52.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不许你反抗
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.68,0:55:16.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是能源部
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.02,0:55:18.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诺雷珠仓库里有可疑份子进入
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.86,0:55:28.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 喂 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.86,0:55:30.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.91,0:55:34.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诺雷珠被偷了 怎么回事呀
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.21,0:55:37.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是有人入侵了能源部
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.67,0:55:40.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抢走了脱出用的诺雷珠
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.45,0:55:42.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会这样...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.36,0:55:45.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去追查
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.99,0:55:48.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论如何都要找回来
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.80,0:56:09.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都到哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.23,0:56:12.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就要向地球告别了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.69,0:56:14.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呀
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.38,0:56:17.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得想个办法离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.39,0:56:21.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快看 是小八
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.45,0:56:28.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果能引开守卫的话
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.81,0:56:32.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 对了 有个好东西
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.54,0:56:33.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.67,0:56:43.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么东西 从什么地方跑进来的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.47,0:56:48.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.84,0:56:50.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八 快趁现在
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.60,0:56:53.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按下那个按钮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.90,0:56:58.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.07,0:56:59.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.95,0:57:02.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之 先出去再说
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.94,0:57:11.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦在那个东西里
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.62,0:57:20.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 科学家们逃走了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.15,0:57:23.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这就去抓他们
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.43,0:57:27.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用了 让他们去吧 反正不会有什么事的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.95,0:57:32.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在已经万事俱备 马上就要出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.68,0:57:40.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.51,0:57:48.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我们快去把这件事禀报大总统吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.53,0:57:49.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.35,0:57:51.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我留在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.44,0:57:55.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去救哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.38,0:57:57.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能丢下哆啦A梦不管
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.63,0:57:59.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是当然的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.36,0:58:00.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.69,0:58:02.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了 我们也留下
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.29,0:58:05.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.65,0:58:06.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.13,0:58:08.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.68,0:58:11.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈带大家去大总统那吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.49,0:58:14.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了 大家要小心呀
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.27,0:58:15.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家保重
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.56,0:58:16.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.48,0:58:20.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.74,0:58:27.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.57,0:58:29.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快看上面
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.10,0:58:42.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个就是时间方舟
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.64,0:58:48.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.09,0:58:50.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有什么好办法吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.46,0:58:53.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 用挂在那里的那个可以飞过去
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.92,0:58:58.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 一口气冲上去的话
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.12,0:59:01.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以从那个轨道飞到那里
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.89,0:59:04.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这么定了 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.80,0:59:17.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等用诺雷珠充电完成后 马上就是时候了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.24,0:59:26.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来就拜托你们了 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.84,0:59:29.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打开开关
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.10,0:59:30.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.47,0:59:32.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 要小心
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.99,0:59:34.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.20,0:59:35.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.66,0:59:43.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.42,0:59:55.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陨石
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.96,1:00:06.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陨石坠落了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.52,1:00:16.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了 大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.01,1:00:17.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.08,1:00:20.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.46,1:00:21.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.26,1:00:36.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁现在
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.56,1:00:39.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.05,1:00:42.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.12,1:00:59.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.01,1:01:05.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是『时光机』的里面
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.86,1:01:07.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把引擎装置关闭吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.39,1:01:08.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.86,1:01:13.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 我可不允许你们这样做
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.48,1:01:16.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出口在哪呀
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.85,1:01:20.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 你干什么的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.63,1:01:23.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 等等 有了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.70,1:01:26.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,名刀『电光丸』
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.66,1:01:28.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.64,1:01:34.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的剑术怎样
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.50,1:01:40.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过其实是『电光丸』做的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.57,1:01:43.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心好了 你们只是昏过去而已
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.74,1:01:44.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是什么人
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.66,1:01:46.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 还有啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.84,1:01:53.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是个臭屁的小子
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.43,1:02:04.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有一点点
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.62,1:02:09.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 人类们觉悟吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.92,1:02:19.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,觉悟吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.87,1:02:21.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.16,1:02:22.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.98,1:02:25.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫杰啦 你的对手是我
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.92,1:02:27.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.22,1:02:28.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里交给我
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.29,1:02:31.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又来搅局吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.76,1:02:33.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去卸引擎
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.24,1:02:34.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.27,1:02:38.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心点呀
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.01,1:02:46.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请大家赶快进行紧急避难
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.82,1:02:51.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.91,1:03:00.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 糟了 没电池了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.83,1:03:06.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胜负已分了 小哆啦
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.50,1:03:22.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个好像是引擎
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.27,1:03:28.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 小八
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.10,1:03:32.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好 我先过去
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.59,1:03:47.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.41,1:03:50.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放手
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.19,1:03:55.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.84,1:03:57.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得快点...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.06,1:04:02.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是夏咪呀
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.59,1:04:04.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.40,1:04:11.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪 去按下起飞杆 马上起飞
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.31,1:04:13.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要呀 夏咪
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.78,1:04:14.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.95,1:04:16.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点去
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.58,1:04:17.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.64,1:04:20.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.17,1:04:26.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做不到
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.09,1:04:30.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚开
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.25,1:04:31.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.91,1:04:34.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是太过分了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.55,1:04:35.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.89,1:04:37.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快住手
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.57,1:04:39.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.25,1:04:45.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫杰啦 我真的真的生气了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.27,1:05:01.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你输了 臭猫
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.48,1:05:03.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我输了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.95,1:05:12.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪 为了我 你要振作呀
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.27,1:05:15.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.97,1:05:18.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.00,1:05:31.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下来了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.25,1:05:33.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害 你怎么办到的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.40,1:05:37.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.40,1:05:51.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掉下来了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.90,1:06:11.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八 小八
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.86,1:06:24.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.41,1:06:39.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.63,1:06:42.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.70,1:06:49.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-喂 喂 乌龟先生 乌龟先生哟-♪-
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.36,1:06:55.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我保证 明天我一定会来的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.72,1:07:04.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我保证 我一定会来的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.59,1:07:12.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 我为了这个约定一直在等啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.35,1:07:36.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大总统 万岁
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.10,1:07:44.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,久等了 大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.17,1:07:46.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们马上就可以见面了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.25,1:07:52.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.72,1:08:13.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 小一
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.71,1:08:17.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊 我就是小一
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.01,1:08:32.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 小八
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.13,1:08:35.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.25,1:08:36.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.48,1:08:39.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了 两个都不会游泳啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.95,1:08:41.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么呢
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.88,1:08:45.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.67,1:08:47.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.71,1:08:52.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.72,1:08:57.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们好像还活着
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.90,1:09:01.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.37,1:09:04.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.92,1:09:05.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.27,1:09:14.43,Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.43,1:09:19.58,Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.58,1:09:24.81,Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.81,1:09:29.03,Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.96,1:09:14.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁在唱歌
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.60,1:09:16.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奶奶？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.84,1:09:26.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 这个声音应该是...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.03,1:09:38.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.24,1:09:43.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.32,1:09:48.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.32,1:09:48.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 小一\N大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.38,1:09:49.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.35,1:09:54.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 我相信你一定会回来的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.83,1:09:57.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 你果然是小一啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.99,1:10:00.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.27,1:10:05.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个你一直带着啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.66,1:10:14.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.33,1:10:15.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.42,1:10:20.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 但是能实现这个约定太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.52,1:10:25.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄总算等到了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.62,1:10:28.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是对方怎么从一千年前...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.58,1:10:32.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,思念的心情创造了奇迹
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.52,1:10:33.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太感人了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.50,1:10:38.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.68,1:10:39.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.72,1:10:42.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小八 诺雷珠落在水里了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.70,1:10:44.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说来...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.92,1:10:51.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诺雷珠碰到水就不能用了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.40,1:10:54.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样的话 脱出用的宇宙船就不能启动了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.40,1:10:56.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.58,1:10:59.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 不能想想办法吗
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.28,1:11:02.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.38,1:11:03.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.28,1:11:06.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.32,1:11:10.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄是神？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.09,1:11:16.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 我想起来了 大家不要担心
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.50,1:11:19.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们先去机场
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.73,1:11:40.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像神社的暗室一样
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.02,1:11:47.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 这就是创造我们国家的神
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.20,1:11:48.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.93,1:11:59.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是大雄呀
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.82,1:12:12.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 那诺雷珠在哪
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.10,1:12:19.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里 这个大雄像全部都是用诺雷珠做的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.07,1:12:21.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.85,1:12:23.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从头到脚都是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.41,1:12:24.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害呀
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.43,1:12:27.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没时间了 大家快点
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.40,1:12:41.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是危险啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.40,1:12:44.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没到吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.04,1:12:45.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要加速了 大家抓紧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.59,1:13:00.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类啊 现在给我掉入黑暗中吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.17,1:13:01.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猫杰啦
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.69,1:13:09.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干掉你们
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.69,1:13:27.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.52,1:13:32.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.71,1:13:35.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系 我拉着
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.56,1:13:39.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上就让你自由
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.75,1:13:44.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是隧道 得救了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.51,1:13:45.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还在追
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.19,1:13:57.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.33,1:14:03.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.18,1:14:05.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.01,1:14:09.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手不能松开 不能掏道具了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.64,1:14:14.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 我们没关系的 你们快走
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.69,1:14:16.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可以
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.75,1:14:30.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 我帮你拿道具
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.63,1:14:33.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.24,1:14:38.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.43,1:14:41.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓到了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.52,1:14:43.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后面
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.04,1:14:52.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.14,1:14:56.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下有趣了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.67,1:14:59.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.67,1:15:02.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快想想办法
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.68,1:15:09.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 拿着那个剑玉
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.07,1:15:11.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.61,1:15:14.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,方向盘拜托了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.02,1:15:16.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.29,1:15:20.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃我下一招
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.19,1:15:23.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 用剑玉直接瞄准他的头部
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.67,1:15:24.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.93,1:15:28.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了 FULL POWER
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.56,1:15:37.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 要去了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.06,1:15:38.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.46,1:15:45.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-喂 喂 乌龟先生 乌龟先生...哟-♪-
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.03,1:15:46.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一群笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.05,1:15:48.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『放大灯』
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.09,1:16:23.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家快点
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.36,1:16:54.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全员都上去了 随时都可以出发
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.47,1:17:01.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『时光机』也修好了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.44,1:17:07.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是帮了很多忙 我代表民众们万分感谢
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.13,1:17:09.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.64,1:17:14.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 这次真的要分手了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.19,1:17:20.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一 和我们一起回21世纪 好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.85,1:17:22.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个不行
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.83,1:17:28.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有责任和大家一起到新的地球上建立新的国家
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.49,1:17:31.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个别人也可以做的啊
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.82,1:17:37.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 不要再为难他了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.29,1:17:42.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像小一这样进化的人型狗不可以带到21世纪的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.23,1:17:45.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如哆啦A梦所说的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.42,1:17:49.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不可以去改变人类的历史
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.01,1:17:51.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 但是...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.94,1:17:58.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了 小一
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.15,1:18:00.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.67,1:18:02.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.02,1:18:02.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夏咪
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.62,1:18:03.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达古 太郎
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.54,1:18:06.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.08,1:18:07.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见 我不会忘了你的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.36,1:18:09.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.87,1:18:14.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保重呀 知子
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.27,1:18:18.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达古 不要感冒哦
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.48,1:18:21.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫才是 不要再只穿内衣外出呀
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.65,1:18:23.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太郎
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.87,1:18:25.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.89,1:18:31.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要出发了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.84,1:18:34.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见 大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.02,1:18:34.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.88,1:18:36.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见 小一
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.63,1:18:38.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见 大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.44,1:18:43.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.85,1:18:44.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小一
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.06,1:18:51.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 大家保重
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.23,1:19:09.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.13,1:19:15.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见 小一
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.66,1:19:23.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 小一
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.19,1:19:29.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-喂 喂 乌龟先生 乌龟先生哟-♪-
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.65,1:19:35.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-全世界没有比你更慢的了-♪-
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.09,1:19:40.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-没有可以束缚你的东西-♪-
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.37,1:19:45.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-♪-然而你为何如此缓慢-♪-
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.05,1:20:22.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球在46亿年间有多少事在重复着
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.31,1:20:29.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,诞生之后消亡 马上又会有新的生命诞生
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.79,1:20:32.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也一样呢
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.03,1:20:36.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有爷爷奶奶 也有爸爸妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.13,1:20:42.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们将来也会变成爸爸妈妈、爷爷奶奶
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.40,1:20:44.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.41,1:20:48.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许说不定什么时候 我们的子孙
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.42,1:20:51.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和小一的子孙会在宇宙的某个地方相遇
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.62,1:20:53.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.75,1:20:55.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧 小一
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.11,1:24:16.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs18\pos(206,435)\1c&HBA9C95&}HKG字幕组&影月字幕组联合\Nwww.ani-comic.info & bbs.lloup.com
